pseudocode:
// 1. zero-out padded steps via x_mark_enc
// 2. Linear: enc_in -> d_model; transpose to [B, D, L]
// 3. FreqAttention: $X_f = \mathrm{rFFT}(x)$; $|X_f|\leftarrow |X_f|\odot W_f$ (learnable); $x\leftarrow x + \mathrm{iFFT}(\text{reweighted})$
// 4. for $i = 1..e_layers$: DilatedConvBlock with rates {1,2,4,8}, residual + GELU
// 5. CrossChannelAttention (SE): GAP -> MLP -> sigmoid, scale channels
// 6. transpose to [B, L, D]; MultiHead temporal SA with mask -> LN(residual + out)
// 7. mask-zero, AdaptiveAvgPool1d -> Linear(D, d_ff) -> GELU -> Dropout -> Linear(d_ff, num_class)

// 1. instance-normalize per channel
// 2. PatchEmbedding(d=64, patch=16, stride=8) -> tokens reshaped to [B, V, P, d]
// 3. for $\ell = 1..e_{\text{layers}}$:
// 4.   TemporalMixer: LN -> MLP across P (P -> 2P -> P), residual
// 5.   VariableMixer: LN -> MLP across V (V -> max(2V,16) -> V), residual
// 6.   FeatureMixer: LN -> MLP across d (d -> d_ff -> d), residual
// 7. Flatten -> Dropout -> Linear(V*P*d, num_class)

// 1. mask-aware InstanceNorm on x; LayerNorm(D=enc_in)
// 2. ChannelTimeMixer (x2):
// 3.   ch = MLP(LN(x))                 // channel mixing
// 4.   local = DWConv_{k=5}(x)          // local time conv per channel
// 5.   diff[i] = x[i] - x[i-1]; diff_local = DWConv_{k=9}(diff)
// 6.   g = sigmoid(MLP([mean(x|mask), mean(|diff|)]))
// 7.   x <- LN(x + ch + g*local + (1-g)*diff_local)
// 8. SpectroTemporalHead: time stats [mean, var, max, min] (4C), log-power FFT proj (4C)
// 9.   gate = sigmoid(MLP([time, freq]))
// 10.  fused = [time*gate, freq*(1-gate), |time-freq|] -> Linear -> num_class
